OL,3,GNEWSAMP proposes school road safety law
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has proposed a new law to improve
OL,7,Froad safety outside schools following
OL,8,Fan accident at a Staffordshire primary.
OL,10,FA group of parents have been
OL,11,Fcampaigning for more than nine months
OL,12,Fafter a father was knocked down at a
OL,13,Fcrossing outside Meadows Primary School
OL,14,Fin Madeley Heath.
OL,16,FThey have been backed by
OL,17,FNewcastle-under-Lyme Labour MP Adam
OL,18,FJogee, who introduced the Road Safety
OL,19,FPlans Bill on 1 September, which
OL,20,Frequires local authorities to prepare a
OL,21,Ftailored plan for every school within
OL,22,Ftheir locality.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
